{"aliases":[],"category":"engineering-design","code_paths":[],"content_hash":"cdf50bab84387cdd8b26e94b7383303b5c167709d4bd4c1858d46c540d7e32ca","content_path":"AgenticDesignPatterns/README.md","difficulty":"intermediate","id":"agenticdesignpatterns-readme","line_count":83,"metadata_path":"ai/meta/notes/agenticdesignpatterns-readme.yaml","reviewed_at":null,"schema_version":1,"section_count":4,"status":"summary","summary":"本书以“智能体（Agentic System）”为核心，探讨如何将大型语言模型（LLM）的能力转化为具备 感知、决策、执行与学习 能力的自治系统。 作者将“开发智能体”比喻为“在画布（Canvas）上作画”——其中画布指代技术框架（如 LangChain、Crew AI、Google ADK 等），而设计模式则是绘画的笔触和结构。","tags":["agenticdesignpatterns","software-engineering"],"test_paths":[],"title":"Agentic Design Patterns","version_scope":[]}
{"aliases":[],"category":"server-architecture","code_paths":[],"content_hash":"112668326a8e70c90d38a23688787416ba9ff9533d6b4aab360aad37dbfcff71","content_path":"BigGameServerDevelopment/README.md","difficulty":"advanced","id":"biggameserverdevelopment-readme","line_count":369,"metadata_path":"ai/meta/notes/biggameserverdevelopment-readme.yaml","reviewed_at":null,"schema_version":1,"section_count":15,"status":"summary","summary":"一致性问题是分布式系统的一大难题，在游戏业务中，开发者一般会把一致性问题抛给具体业务去处理。对于图1-16所示的异常情况，需要给每个交易赋予唯一编号。程序C除了转发消息，还需要记录程序A对每个交易的执行状态，如果转发失败，程序C要在稍后重发交易消息，直到程序A成功执行。而程序A也需要记录每个交易的状态，如果某个交易已经成功执行，则不再响应程序C发来的消息，避免重复添加道具。","tags":["architecture","biggameserverdevelopment","server"],"test_paths":[],"title":"百万在线---大型游戏服务端开发","version_scope":[]}
