{"aliases":[],"category":"client-engine","code_paths":[],"content_hash":"833b258302ae29de8d0904b503e86a412d864c7ad0a58dcb0f982595d1fa6fd0","content_path":"ProfessionalUnity3D/第一章架构.md","difficulty":"advanced","id":"professionalunity3d-第一章架构","line_count":103,"metadata_path":"ai/meta/notes/professionalunity3d-第一章架构.yaml","reviewed_at":null,"schema_version":1,"section_count":6,"status":"reviewed","summary":"软件系统架构可以理解为是软件程序的架子，和现实中的书架相比有异曲同工之妙，这个架子上有很多大大小小的格子，每个格子里都可以放固定种类的程序。架子有大有小，大的需要花费点去做，小的轻便快捷。","tags":["game-development","professionalunity3d","unity"],"test_paths":[],"title":"第一章 架构","version_scope":["Unity 2019.4+"]}
{"aliases":[],"category":"client-engine","code_paths":[],"content_hash":"ae265695f711c029a714cecc2ba301c4b3d7629815b6890acf72ef2f43454f47","content_path":"ProfessionalUnity3D/第七章游戏中的AI.md","difficulty":"advanced","id":"professionalunity3d-第七章游戏中的ai","line_count":147,"metadata_path":"ai/meta/notes/professionalunity3d-第七章游戏中的ai.yaml","reviewed_at":null,"schema_version":1,"section_count":10,"status":"reviewed","summary":"AI机器人在游戏中非常普遍，它们常以模仿人类的行为在游戏中活动。游戏中的怪物的自动行为比较普遍，这种简单的人工智能方式可以用几种不同的方式进行编写，主要的两种方式：一种为容易被人类思维接受的状态机，另一种是为机器人策略型思考方式编写的行为树。","tags":["game-development","professionalunity3d","unity"],"test_paths":[],"title":"第七章 游戏中的 AI","version_scope":["Unity 2019.4+"]}
{"aliases":[],"category":"client-engine","code_paths":[],"content_hash":"9e7c9df5e79783ff10ed078220a054e0c58a858c469d93626e8ddf443083cb8d","content_path":"ProfessionalUnity3D/第三章数据表.md","difficulty":"advanced","id":"professionalunity3d-第三章数据表","line_count":97,"metadata_path":"ai/meta/notes/professionalunity3d-第三章数据表.yaml","reviewed_at":null,"schema_version":1,"section_count":4,"status":"reviewed","summary":"为什么会更加小，二进制比特流在存储数字时，会直接用二进制形式存储，比如，txt文本中23345是“23345”这个字符串，占用了5个字符，每个字符2个字节，就用了10个字节，而二进制比特流则在存储时可以直接使用二个字节(short)存储’23345‘这个数字，所以数据比特流形式的数据存储文件更加小。一个以文本形式的txt文件来建立的10MB的数据文件，转化为2进制格式后，可以压缩到几百KB甚至几十KB。","tags":["game-development","professionalunity3d","unity"],"test_paths":[],"title":"第三章 数据表","version_scope":["Unity 2019.4+"]}
{"aliases":[],"category":"client-engine","code_paths":[],"content_hash":"743ab331ea5d2dcb20ddde7a47704d735f3b29df4a8386dc9bd3086de71c9d8d","content_path":"ProfessionalUnity3D/第九章渲染管线与图形学.md","difficulty":"advanced","id":"professionalunity3d-第九章渲染管线与图形学","line_count":489,"metadata_path":"ai/meta/notes/professionalunity3d-第九章渲染管线与图形学.yaml","reviewed_at":null,"schema_version":1,"section_count":15,"status":"reviewed","summary":"欧拉角的定义是，x,y,z 分别表达了x轴上的旋转角度，y轴上的旋转角度，z轴上的旋转角度，即(20,40,50) 表达了在x轴上旋转20度，y轴上旋转40度，z轴上旋转50度。看起来简单易懂就能定义坐标系上的旋转角度，为什么就不能使用它来表达所有的旋转角度，却还要使用四元数呢？其实是有原因的。","tags":["game-development","professionalunity3d","unity"],"test_paths":[],"title":"第九章 渲染管线与图形学","version_scope":["Unity 2019.4+"]}
